TEXT 0 112 Left 2 ;Power Supply - single 24V input, virtual-ground split for the audio (preamp) branch,\nisolated black-box load for the motor branch (schematic version of power_supply.cir).\nVraw_src = ideal stand-in for the COTS 24V DC brick.\nSAFETY-SENSITIVE: Dpol part/rating and fuse rating are PLACEHOLDERS - confirm with user.\nRfuse models normal-operation resistance only (no blow model).
TEXT 0 1152 Left 2 ;Virtual ground: divider + unity-gain buffer -> VGND.\nXvg uses IDEAL_OPAMP (supply pins drawn for the symbol, unused by the model);\nreplace with a real general-purpose op-amp or rail-splitter (e.g. TLE2426) when finalizing.
TEXT 1104 224 Left 2 ;Motor branch: BLACK BOX per motor-branch-interface-spec.md.\n0 -> 200mA step at t=2ms; watch V(VRAW), V(VGND) for sag.
TEXT 0 1104 Left 2 ;Integration: tie riaa_preamp "0" to VGND, VCC to VRAW, VEE to this sheet's 0 (PGND).
